## Phase 2 � Database Schema

```
Prompt:
```

> Create an IndexedDB module at `src/lib/db.ts` using the `idb` library. Define a database called `since-timer-db` with these object stores:
>
> **entries** store � keyPath: `id` (auto-increment):
> - `title` string
> - `category` � `purchase | task | event | routine`
> - `entry_date` string (ISO)
> - `next_due_date` string | null
> - `price` number | null
> - `notes` string | null
> - `reminder_enabled` boolean
> - `reminder_time` string | null
> - `created_at` string
>
> **history** store � keyPath: `id`, with index on `entry_id`:
> - `entry_id` number
> - `logged_date` string
> - `notes` string
>
> **settings** store � keyPath: `key`:
> - `history_months` default 6
>
> Expose typed async CRUD functions: `insertEntry`, `getAllEntries`, `updateEntry`, `deleteEntry`, `getHistoryForEntry`, `pruneOldHistory(months)`.

