## Phase 7 � Browser Notifications

```
Prompt:
```

> Create `src/lib/notifications.ts`:
> - `requestPermission()` � prompts browser notification access
> - `scheduleReminder(entry)` � uses `setTimeout` calculated from `next_due_date` + `reminder_time` to fire a `new Notification(...)` in the browser tab
> - `cancelReminder(entryId)` � clears the timeout
> - `rescheduleAll(entries)` � call on app load to restore reminders
>
> Note to Claude: browser notifications only fire while the tab is open � add a small banner warning users of this limitation.

