## Key Advantage Over Expo

> Open terminal ? `npm run dev` ? app is live in your browser in under 10 seconds. No phone, no emulator, no QR codes. When ready to share, deploy to Vercel in one command: `npx vercel`.


### Build the UI : like a calm, premium personal dashboard.

Use shadcn/ui as the component foundation.
Use Tailwind CSS and TypeScript.
Prefer cards over tables.
Use generous whitespace.
Dark mode by default.
Avoid bright colors and excessive animations.
Take visual inspiration from Apple Health and Linear.
The app should feel like an external memory for life maintenance, not a task manager.